  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CE12111",
    "sub_id": "66250",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<ol>\n\t<li>本科目採百分記分法。</li>\n\t<li>當我發現您的學習進度跟不上、可能會妨礙學業成功之疑慮時，我可能會發出預警訊息給您、及您的學習導師。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. No late homework is accepted.\n2. In general, no make-up quiz/exam will be given. Students must take the initiative to ask the teacher to apply for a make-up quiz/exam and, if granted, must complete the make-up quiz/exam within 2 days after the quiz/exam ends.\n3. Be on-time for the class. Class absence will be marked if no show when the name is called.\n4. Forged class attendance, Forged cause or document of leave will be subjected to severe penalty: failed grades.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "本教學以板書為主，數位投影為輔。學生必須帶筆記本。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試<br />\n中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送，並通知導師。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
